# apk — Alpine Linux package manager

## Install a package

```sh
apk add $package
```

## Remove a package

```sh
apk del $package
```

## Update repos and upgrade all packages

```sh
apk update
apk upgrade
```

## Find a package

```sh
apk search $package
```

## Real-world: slim Docker image on the homelab

```dockerfile
FROM alpine:latest
# --no-cache updates the index and skips the local cache in one shot
RUN apk add --no-cache python3 py3-pip curl
```

## Real-world: inspect an Alpine container

```sh
# What owns this file?
apk info --who-owns /usr/bin/curl

# List installed packages
apk info
```

| Flag       | What it does                             |
| ---------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| --no-cache | update index + skip cache (Dockerfiles)  |
| -v         | verbose output                           |
| --simulate | show what would happen, change nothing   |
